		{"id":"b919cf60630839a5","type":"text","text":"#### *Homework For the end of the autumn Holiday*\n**Homework: Chapter 1**\n- **Study past simple** *p.81*\n- **Study past continuous** *p.81*\n- **Study the difference between past simple and past continuous** *p.81*\n- **Learn the irregular verbs** *p.218-219*\n **Study the vocabulary for:**\n    - **travelling** \n    - **packing** \n    - **holiday activities** \n    - **weather** \n\t - **Words A**\n\t - **Words C**\n\t - **Words F**\n\t - **Words G**\n- **Study the Stones phrases about holidays**\n- **Be able to describe a past holiday and say what happened**\n\n## *Chapter 1 Test 29th of October*","x":-324,"y":71,"width":511,"height":635,"color":"1"}
